<title>USA: Home City stake increased by Jerome Davis.</title>
<headline>Home City stake increased by Jerome Davis.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investor Jerome Davis and his wife said Friday they increased their total stake in Home City Financial Corp to 92,541 shares or 9.71 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the investors said they most recently purchased 17,500 shares in transactions on March 27 and April 2 at prices ranging from $13.125 to $13.625 a share.</p>
